Package: rewRI
Title: Reference Interval Estimation from Re-Weighted BC or YJ Transformation
Version: 0.0.1.0000
Authors@R: 
    person("Tobias", "Blatter", , "tobias.blatter@extern.insel.ch", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-0298-8177"))
Description: This package supports the fully automated estimation of direct reference intervals (RIs) from clinical cohort data. An accompanying graphical output further helps to assess the accuracy of the inferred estimates.
